const rawContentHtml = "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Part 25, more optional dungeons! We like those don't we?\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#The_Forgotten_Land\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Forgotten Land</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Forging_Deeper\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Forging Deeper</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Beyond_the_Desert\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Beyond the Desert</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#The_Dragon_King&#39;s_Lair\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Dragon King's Lair</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Five_Final_Floors\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Five Final Floors</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Forgotten_Land\">The Forgotten Land</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Forgotten Land\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_25?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Forgotten Land\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's go find a moogle to get chain skills from - we want three Multichains, a Jump Chain, and a KP Gambler. Teleport to Gaia and head into the gateway.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">I\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/29?cb=20110204003934\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Ultimate Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Delusory Warlock\"><img alt=\"Delusory Warlock\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20110204003912\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-e