4000919\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fleeting Flash\"><img alt=\"Fleeting Flash\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Strange Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20110204000919\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/f/fc/DFF_Potion.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235732\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Potion\"><img alt=\"Potion\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/f/fc/DFF_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/21?cb=20110203235732\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Anything besides a Round Chain will do the job here. Straight Chain anywhere down F column or beat your Assist and Cross Chain from D3. I had to settle for opening the red chest and using a Jump Chain where it lay at G3.\n</p><p>The Party consists of a Level 80 False Stalwart with Behemoth and a Level 80 Counterfeit Wraith with Atomos and a Counterfeit Youth. The Strange enemy is a Level 100 Fleeting Flash, she uses Bahamut and then spams Crushing Blow. The chest enemy at G3 is a Level 125 Imitation Despot, he uses Omega, calls an Imitation Liegeman for an Assist, and when beaten relinquishes a random piece of Lufenian equipment, can never have enough of that can we?\n</p><p>The chest at G1 has another Titan's Tear. The chest at D3 guarded by your Assist has a random skill again.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Forging_Deeper\">Forging Deeper</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Forging Deeper\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_25?action=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Forging Deeper\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Chain Skill\"><img alt=\"Chain 