asy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Tree\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Tree\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Ultimate Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/29?cb=20110204003934\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Multichain at A1 to get them all. I lacked one, and if you do you have two options. You can fight your Assist and the chest enemy, then chain the enemies in pairs manually, or fight them one by one. I did the former.\n</p><p>The chest enemy is a Level 127 Phantasmal Harlequin with Omega. Spoils are once again a Lufenian item. The Ultimate enemy is a Level 126 Fallacious Tree with Ultima Weapon and a Fallacious Wanderer. Terra perished here, I let it go because the Tree was left with 100 HP, and there's a Phoenix Down on the next floor. Cloud finished up and Lightning was made party leader again. Next, a Level 91 Ephemeral Phantom with Omega. Then come the last two enemies, a Level 91 Transient Witch with Deathgaze and oh, let me guess, a Level 91 Capricious Reaper with Calcabrina and a Capricious Thief? I <i>am</i> psychic!\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/f/f5/D012_Phoenix_Down.png/revision/latest?cb=20120409211126\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Phoenix Down\"><img alt=\"Phoenix Down\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"10\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Phoenix Down.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Phoenix_Down.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/f/f5/D012_Phoenix_Down.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/10?cb=20120409211126\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/2/24/DFF_Ultimate_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Ultima