6224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d6/Dissidia_opened_chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204002016\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Champion/Lufenian Equipment\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Champion/Lufenian Equipment\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissidia opened chest.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissidia_opened_chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d6/Dissidia_opened_chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110204002016\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d6/Dissidia_opened_chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204002016\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lady of Antiquity/Lufenian Equipment\"><img alt=\"Lady of Antiquity/Lufenian Equipment\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissidia opened chest.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissidia_opened_chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d6/Dissidia_opened_chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110204002016\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d6/Dissidia_opened_chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204002016\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Horror of Antiquity/Lufenian Equipment\"><img alt=\"Horror of Antiquity/Lufenian Equipment\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissidia opened chest.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissidia_opened_chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d6/Dissidia_opened_chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110204002016\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>As we enter, we see a scene of Cosmos calling out to the Great Will, telling it she cannot use her warriors as pawns anymore. In this gateway, here now, the mured moogle regains his memories and reveals his true identity to us, which I won't spoil. The time has come for him to tell us everything.\n</p><p>As you can tell, chain skills are slightly useless here, can't chain chest enemies after all. The four chest enemies are a Level 79 Lady of Antiquity with Carbuncle, a Level 79 Warrior of Antiquity with Zalera, a Level 123 Imaginary Champion with Ultima Weapon and an Imaginary Soldier, and a Level 80 Horror of Antiquity with Hecatoncheir and a Lady of Antiquity. The Party consists of a Level 98 Transient Gunner with Lich, a Level 98 Ephemeral Summoner with Atomos, and a Level 98 False Hero with Phoenix.\n</p><p>The chest has 30,000 gil, sure, money is always welcome.\n</p><p>As we leave the newly shattered gateway, the moogle tells us that the Feral Chaos we beat was a manikin of Chaos, from when he was sealed in the Land of Discord. There, the true Chaos awaits.\n</p><p>But first, we have a new multi-floor gateway to go to! Yup, another one kiddies! I know, would you feel more willing if I let you know that it contains the trade materials needed for the Level 100 character-exclusive weapons?...well too bad, we're going anyway! Go buy two Multichains, two Jump Chains and a KP Gambler. I stopped by the Frozen Continent gateway first, had some KP Bonuses to use up to make room. Head to a teleport stone and head to the new location, the Dragon Caves\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"The_Dragon_King.27s_Lair\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Dragon_King's_Lair\">The Dragon King's Lair</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Dragon King&#39;s Lair\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_25?action=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Dragon King&#39;s Lair\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Horror of Antiquity\"><i