ed.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Red.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ac/D012_Emblem_Red.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050655\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The mured moogle tells us this is where Shinryu rested during the cycles of war, or at least where he used to. The bonus line is 100 and the KP Chance is a 60 second win - choose your summons wisely, kiddies, or else the Level 120 enemies will trip you up. Multichain at A3 where we enter to chain them all.\n</p><p>First up, a Level 81 Fallacious Tree with the Gilgamesh summon. Then comes a Level 79 Warrior of Antiquity with Zalera. Third, a Level 80 Horror of Antiquity with Hecatoncheir. Fourth, what a shock, a Level 79 Lady of Antiquity with Carbuncle. Last, the Ultimate, a Level 123 Fallacious Wanderer with Ultima Weapon and a Fallacious Giant Assist.\n</p><p>Well, next floor!\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><