e\" title=\"Imaginary Soldier/Lv. 100 Exclusive Equipment accessory\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Soldier/Lv. 100 Exclusive Equipment accessory\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissidia opened chest.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissidia_opened_chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/d/d6/Dissidia_opened_chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110204002016\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Straight Chain at A1 to get all the enemies, if you've picked one up. The four red chests are all Level 120 enemies, but they yield the trade accessories for the Level 100 weapons. As you get each such accessory the weapon it's needed for will appear in the shop, unless you have a Level 90 exclusive weapon in which case the next one up is already there and you know exactly what accessory you need for it. <span class=\"new\" title=\"List of Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy Weapons (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGlzdF9vZl9EaXNzaWRpYV8wMTJfRmluYWxfRmFudGFzeV9XZWFwb25zP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">This link</span> lists the exclusive weapons, if you're unsure which ones are exclusive to which characters. Once you get the level 100 trade accessory for a weapon though, it will appear in the shop and you can just check them who uses it.\n</p><p>The Expert enemies are a Level 91 Ephemeral Phantom with Malboro, a Level 97 Fleeting Flash with Odin and a Delusory Warlock, and a Level 97 Idle Sky Pirate with Cactuar and a Warrior of Antiquity. Wow, the Experts are <i>almost</i> up to Level 100! The chest enemies are a Level 122 False Hero with Ultima Weapon and a False Stalwart, a Level 120 Idle Sky Pirate with Omega and a Warrior of Antiquity, a Level 123 Delusory Knight with Omega, and a Level 124 Imaginary Soldier with Ultima Weapon and an Imaginary Brawler.\n</p><p>With your spoils, considering getting the Level 100 weapons of anyone you're using now and were fortunate enough to find the proper trade items for.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Five_Final_Floors\">Five Final Floors</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Five Final Floors\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_25?action=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Five Final Floors\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span 